"Aunt Claire was the first to the cashier. She emptied the contents of her shopping cart on the counter. The cashier quickly scanned everything in, totaled it up and then Aunt Claire paid. I helped Carla to bag everything and she helped me when it was Dad’s turn.": "0dc45773f668",
"Bears eat a great deal of food in autumn before they hibernate for the winter.": "ec582810f555",
