"Local residents were asked to evacuate before the storm arrived.": "04772c6bd564",
"Lushan is a quiet, isolated community nestled in the mountains of Nantou County. I have been there 3 times and love the atmosphere. It is peaceful, quiet and cool. It is, or at least was, my favorite place to visit in Taiwan.": "708cd94978f4",
"Making up believable excuses was definitely Carl’s forte.": "6e69afeb124f",
